WEBVTT

NOTE
Source : piste en-US manuelle publiée par l'auteur sur https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=O7ss--t2hgI (relevé 2026-11-28).
Texte reproduit sans correction. Synchronisée sur la version YouTube : recaler sur le master après qualification si son début diffère.

1
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:06.840
Do it ..

2
00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:10.040
You know there’s no time to waste

3
00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:13.040
So... Go for it!

4
00:02:28.488 --> 00:02:30.248
At the age of 10,

5
00:02:30.321 --> 00:02:33.361
I lost my father in a helicopter crash.

6
00:02:34.569 --> 00:02:37.569
Today, I’ve lived longer than he did,

7
00:02:38.100 --> 00:02:41.279
And that voice, I feel it deep inside .

8
00:02:41.279 --> 00:02:43.571
Inner voice: You know there's no time to waste. Go for it

9
00:02:43.571 --> 00:02:45.842
And if your life were to end tomorrow.

10
00:02:45.842 --> 00:02:48.901
What would the voice buried in your chest say to you?

11
00:02:49.458 --> 00:02:50.778
Mine,

12
00:02:50.839 --> 00:02:52.505
told me to fly.

13
00:02:53.295 --> 00:02:55.652
And my parents, when they left…

14
00:02:55.652 --> 00:02:57.372
gave me wings!

